{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09206","headline":"荅崔主簿问兼简温上人 · 韦应物","name":"荅崔主簿问兼简温上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缘情生衆累，晚悟依道流。\n诸境一已寂，了将身世浮。\n闲居澹无味，忽复四时周。\n靡靡芳草积，稍稍新篁抽。\n即此抱余素，块然诚寡俦。\n自适一忻意，愧蒙君子忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}